                            rdfs:comment "Possibility of producing a new product from waste objects, products or components through actions involving at least one change that may affect the product performance, purpose or type."@en ;
                            rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-repairability> ;
                            rdfs:label "Possibility of remanufacturing"@en ;
                            <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#sourceLocator> "JRC Preparatory Study, relevant section, printed pages 16-17, lines 222-225; JRC Preparatory Study, Section 13.10.1.13, printed pages 480-481, lines 11645-11673; JRC Preparatory Study, relevant section, Table 2, printed page 15; caption line 219."@en ;
                            <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#sourceType> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#adaptedDefinition> .


