                <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#sourceType> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#adaptedDefinition> .


###  https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-repairability#RepairRelatedProcess
:RepairRelatedProcess rdf:type owl:Class ;
                      rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-process#TextileProcess> ;
                      <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://susproc.jrc.ec.europa.eu/product-bureau/sites/default/files/2025-12/Textile-Prep-Study_3rd-Milestone_20251212.pdf> ;
                      rdfs:comment "Textile process type related to upgrade, refurbishment or remanufacturing and organised with repair under the broader family of life-extension interventions. Concrete operations are represented as txtprc:TextileProcessExecution."@en ;
                      rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-repairability> ;
                      rdfs:label "Repair-related life-extension process"@en ;
